WEBVTT

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:04.930
And that sense of ambiguous loss
is most exemplified

00:02:04.963 --> 00:02:07.363
in what we are experiencing at this moment

00:02:07.363 --> 00:02:09.730
as the loss of Eros.

00:02:09.763 --> 00:02:13.530
And the pandemic gripped the world.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:17.530
And then the pendulum that swings
between freedom and security

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.630
has snapped off its hinge.

00:02:19.663 --> 00:02:25.097
There is a constant, extreme
emphasis on safety

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:26.863
and it cordons off.

00:02:27.997 --> 00:02:32.430
We avoid the spaces where we can
experience happenstance,